  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_FrogDog</defName>
    <label>frog dog</label>
    <description>Frog dogs (sometimes referred to as "frog-dogs" or "frogdogs") were a species of reptillians with both frog-like and dog-like features. The creatures hopped and waddled from place to place. Frog-dog vocalizations sounded like throaty barks and croaks. This variant was popular on planets such as At Attin due to their bright, inquisitive, loyal, and attentive nature. "At Attin frogdogs" were sought for the companionship they offered and kept as domestic pets.</description>
